  "scope": "Development-only real-browser DOM geometry, leaf text-span bounds, raw KaTeX SVG path data when present, and browser screenshot artifacts. The 29-case pilot includes all nine pinned original cases, literal verbatim punctuation and spacing at 12, 16, 20, 24, 32, and 48 CSS/native pixels per em, text cedilla and circled-R, widecheck/utilde over six characters, phase/angle constructs, canonical 2x2 CD geometry, and KaTeX newline macro literal-bracket behavior. No full math-dialect parity, semantic component mapping, or product acceptance is claimed."
